# The research picker moved with Tab and Backspace, a letter looked up, and Space to choose (see picktech.scene for how it is
# opened).
25 load
48 click 362 734
50 open tech_pick
58 click 511 423
62 click 511 444
68 snap open
70 key Tab               # right
74 snap key-tab
76 key Backspace         # left
80 snap key-backspace
82 key p                 # a letter
86 snap key-letter
88 key Space             # chooses
96 snap chosen-space
100 close
